    .string "Hi! Is it your first time here at\n"
    .string "the SAFARI ZONE?$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_ExplainSafariZone::
    .string "The SAFARI ZONE has four main\n"
    .string "ecosystem areas.\p"
    .string "Each area features wild POKéMON\n"
    .string "for cataloging research.\p"
    .string "Register with us to receive 30\n"
    .string "RESEARCH BALLS for your session!$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_ReserveContestExplain::
    .string "Welcome!\p"
    .string "We are conducting Oak-style\n"
    .string "specimen research today.\p"
    .string "Which evaluation category would\n"
    .string "you like to enter?$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_SessionStarted::
    .string "Excellent! Here are 30 RESEARCH\n"
    .string "BALLS for your session.\p"
    .string "Catch a specimen in the Reserve\n"
    .string "and bring it back for evaluation!$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_MustHaveOneMonInParty::
    .string "To enter the Reserve Contest, you\n"
    .string "must have exactly 1 POKéMON in\l"
    .string "your party.\p"
    .string "Please store extra POKéMON in the\n"
    .string "PC and come back!$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_MustRegisterFirst::
    .string "Hold on there!\p"
    .string "You must register with the Reserve\n"
    .string "Attendant before entering!$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_GoodLuckInReserve::
    .string "Good luck with your specimen\n"
    .string "search!$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Entrance_Text_WelcomeBackLetUsEvaluate::
    .string "Welcome back!\n"
    .string "Let's evaluate your specimen!$"

